WEBVTT

00:43:57.763 --> 00:44:01.759
like, 65-size font or something,
all in red, and it said something like,

00:44:01.783 --> 00:44:05.621
"Holy shit! Drop everything!
Write, woman, write!"

00:44:05.645 --> 00:44:06.781
(Laughter)

00:44:06.805 --> 00:44:09.054
SC: And I still have that
framed in my office.

00:44:09.078 --> 00:44:12.501
And he's like that all the time
about everything.

00:44:12.525 --> 00:44:17.064
And it's really amazing to be
on the receiving end of it.

00:44:17.088 --> 00:44:19.861
And I always feel like I have to remember

00:44:19.885 --> 00:44:23.999
when there's something good
that's happening on his side

00:44:24.023 --> 00:44:27.406
that I'm never going to match that
because I express myself differently,

00:44:27.430 --> 00:44:32.350
but to try to show the enthusiasm
in a way that will feel real to him.